30,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The budget is tighter than we thought, and off-site work doesn't bring in any regional funding.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shion,,"It seems some past trials actually reduced readmissions, but joint clinics often fail due to budget disputes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Midori,,"We have a nursing shortage in the wards, but the midwifery team actually has some unexpected capacity.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The car park and rooms are already full, and the booking system ignores anything without a fixed slot.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"External data agreements take forever to sign, and home visits are often missed due to access issues.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, if the booking system is that limited, we need a program with very clear, fixed appointments.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, that aligns with the data. We need something that is measurable and doesn't rely on vague coordination.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, if home visits are unreliable, perhaps we should focus on services delivered within our own walls.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, but the rooms are already full! We can't just add more on-site clinics without a plan.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, that is a very good point. We must be careful not to seize up the hospital.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,We need a program that generates revenue or fits the current budget without hidden costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shion,,I agree. We should avoid anything that requires complex external agreements or joint departmental budgets.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Midori,,"Given the midwifery slack, a program utilizing them would be the most sustainable for the staff.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"If we use existing slack in a way that doesn't clog the parking lot, it might work.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Let's see the candidates and see which one fits these constraints.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
