55,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Candidate B and C are on-site, which helps funding. But B needs space, which Kenji says we lack.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Candidate A is like the call-back trial that worked, but Shizue noted the issues with home visits.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Candidate C uses midwifery, where we have slack. It's a perfect fit for the current staffing levels.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Candidate C is scheduled, but will it fill the parking lot more? Still, it's better than B.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Candidate D requires those external data agreements I found are nearly impossible to finalize quickly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,Candidate C is the safest bet for the budget if it's managed well within the departments.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shion,,"I agree. A is too risky for completion, and D is a bureaucratic nightmare. C is logical.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Midori,,I feel very strongly about C. It supports the staff and the community without overstretching the nurses.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Kenji,,I can support C. It's a specific service that can be scheduled tightly in the booking system.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with everyone. Candidate C seems the most harmonious choice for our current situation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we have a consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shion,,Indeed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we agree.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Kenji,,Me too!,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It is a lovely solution.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
